  "bio": "Ellie D is a masterful tattoo artist with an exceptional talent for illustrative styles, offering a vibrant take on each design she crafts. Her professionalism is evident not only in her meticulous approach to tattooing but also in her strict policy against taking tattoo inquiries through social media, ensuring that all client communications are handled with utmost attention and care. Ellie's dedication to her craft is matched by her commitment to maintaining a clean and hygienic workspace, providing clients with a safe and reassuring environment for their tattoo experience.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location:\n\nTattoo Designs & crafting\n💍🐼💜 @chef.de.hashish \nTattoos --> @ellie.d.tattoo\nWork --> @apricity.tattoo in Kitchener, Ont\n👇🏼for tattoo inquiries\n\nTattoo Designs & crafting\n💍🐼💜 @chef.de.hashish \nTattoos --> @ellie.d.tattoo\nWork --> @apricity.tattoo in Kitchener, Ont\n👇🏼for tattoo inquiries",
